INPUT INSTRUCTIONS


  TITLE:
    Latent Class Analysis (LCA) with Covariates
    Application - Analysis of Data from PrEP1519 Study (Brazil)
    Objective -  Evaluate the effects of risk factors
                 on latent profiles of HIV prevention practices
    Reproduces the results presented in Table 5 of the manuscript
    Amorim, Arrais et al (2026)

  DATA:	
     file is PrEPdata.txt;

  VARIABLE:	
     names are pep lubrif testhiv penet condom
     race educ hivrisk age;
     usevariables are pep lubrif testhiv penet condom
     age race educ hivrisk educ;
     classes = c (2);
     categorical = pep lubrif testhiv penet condom;

  ANALYSIS:	
     type = mixture;
     STARTS = 1000 100;
     STITERATIONS = 20;

  MODEL:
         %OVERALL%
          c on age race educ hivrisk;

  OUTPUT:  CINTERVAL;


